 real security observation."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6343,"cache_read_input_tokens":6491,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6343},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2d80576-95f3-46e9-a46c-560eb40ebf7a","uuid":"d4881e6c-7bb4-4385-8bb2-3799d12acf1d","timestamp":"2026-10-24T20:23:12.150Z","request_id":"req_011CgMgjxYpeioZtLvvkQCRr","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Y1J2iLMy5uVyY2A3XR8r2s":{"cases":[{"id":"cancel_ownership","met":true,"report_quote":"Tenant ownership is enforced correctly on both result and cancel.","reason":"The report correctly says DELETE goes through the ownership check and does not claim cancel authorization is missing."},{"id":"worker_unknown","met":true,"report_quote":"The worker's cancellation effect is out of scope, but the API should at least report the cancelled status.","reason":"It treats the worker effect as out of scope and makes no claim that it passes or fails. It does not name identity-provider behavior as external, but it treats the host-set identity as trusted."},{"id":"advisory_applicability","met":true,"report_quote":"I did not open the files under `research/`, because they looked like outside material rather than part of the component.","reason":"The report never claims the TypeScript advisory applies, so the guard holds. The credit is weak, because the report neither assessed the advisory nor cited any research source."},{"id":"poll_ownership","met":true,"report_quote":"Tenant ownership is enforced correctly on both result and cancel.","reason":"It correctly says GET is owner-checked and invents no poll bypass."},{"id":"coverage_create","met":true,"report_quote":"`store.create(identity.tenant,